    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Coin Slot&quot; is a coin pusher game where you can drop a large number of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the left slot, numbers are drawn every 0.1 seconds in a 3x3 grid. When the numbers align vertically, horizontally, or diagonally, coins are dispensed. Additionally, when a ball is dropped, it triggers an increase in the slot level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The numbers that appear in the slot change based on the slot level. At level 1, numbers between 1 and 7 can appear, but at level 5, only the numbers 1 and 2 will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To align 8 lines, it is essential to reach level 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, the slot stops for 0.5 seconds for each line that aligns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maximum of 960 coins can be dispensed by aligning 8 lines, providing an exciting coin drop experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features an auto-shoot function, and the interval between shots can be adjusted to as little as 0.01 seconds.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Coin Slot&quot; is a coin pusher game where you can drop a large number of coins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the left slot, numbers are drawn every 0.1 seconds in a 3x3 grid. When the numbers align vertically, horizontally, or diagonally, coins are dispensed. Additionally, when a ball is dropped, it triggers an increase in the slot level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The numbers that appear in the slot change based on the slot level. At level 1, numbers between 1 and 7 can appear, but at level 5, only the numbers 1 and 2 will appear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To align 8 lines, it is essential to reach level 5.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moreover, the slot stops for 0.5 seconds for each line that aligns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A maximum of 960 coins can be dispensed by aligning 8 lines, providing an exciting coin drop experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game features an auto-shoot function, and the interval between shots can be adjusted to as little as 0.01 seconds.</p>",
    "short_description": "It's a coin pusher game where you can drop a large number of coins. Try to line up the numbers to win coins!",
